DeepSeek Harness (dsh)
https://www.npmjs.com/package/@deepseek-ai/dsh

The application and tray icons in src-tauri/icons/ and app-icon.png are derived
from the DeepSeek whale in the dsh frontend's favicon.svg. scripts/gen-icons.js
regenerates them from that source.

DSH Desktop launches `dsh web` as a subprocess and displays it, but does not
bundle, vendor, or redistribute dsh itself -- the user installs it separately
via npm. Only the icon artwork above is derived material.

